      "note": "Resolved 21 September 2026 by decision D2 and proposals P1 and P2: the introduction now says \"trust in science and modern medicine\", and the page states that UPL heals the spirit, medicine treats the body, and a follower never relies on spiritual or alternative remedies alone.",
      "concept": "medicine"
