        "content/1-foundations/core-beliefs/unity.md",
        "content/1-foundations/author-note.md"
      ],
      "note": "Resolved 21 September 2026 by decision D1 and proposals P4 to P9: God is not a person but the source of light. Comparative Analysis and the God page now say so, \"God's love\" is explained as the nature of the light, \"divine will\" became \"divine order\", and prayer is attunement. Unity still describes Tawhid in Islam's own terms, which is a description of Islam and not of UPL's God.",
      "concept": "god"
    },
